Page ID: `research`.
UI owner: `components/hades/pages/research-page.tsx`; Obsidian: `obsidian/pages/research-obsidian.tsx`.
API contract: research/project/report/event methods in `lib/hades-api.ts`.
Backend owners: `ResearchRunner`, `WebResearchService` and related services in `backend/platform_services_core.py` (public facade in `platform_services.py`), persistence in `backend/platform_db.py`, research routes in `backend/main.py`, conflict handling in `backend/research_conflicts.py`.
Do not inspect PluginManager merely because it shares the platform-services module.
